{"server":"tw","storyId":"act16side_level_act16side_06_end","groupId":"act16side","stageId":"act16side_06","title":"安魂曲","storyCode":"GA-6","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16side/level_act16side_06_end.txt","sourceHash":"7707990bdef72d117b149d10f1ac2f17972f4ef1a2ea8f55a385f45d9191aa0b","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g11_laterano_alley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"艾澤爾，左前方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好險！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說，我們也打不出個結果，要不然算了吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真是完全不聽人說話啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾澤爾，你不是最擔心塞茜莉亞的安危嗎？其實說不定塞茜莉亞在我手裡會更安全哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為我會相信嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從來不說假話的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你說的是真的，塞茜莉亞自己不願意，那就不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有時候我真覺得，安多恩給我添了很多麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"不要分神，艾澤爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......費德里科前輩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有沒有感覺到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"艾澤爾，行動變更，你去鐘樓確認情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"這個反叛信使交給我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g4_laterano_cathedralliving"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教宗閣下，這是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噓——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇爾麗芙，關閉中廳，暫停一切會面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底發生了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的前任，上一代教宗，很喜歡研究歷史，這件事你聽說過嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......確實沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不怪你，他實在太蹩腳了。他那些文章錯漏百出，讓人不敢恭維。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與其說是在研究歷史，不如說他喜歡把歷史當成材料，盡情發揮他的想像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他喜歡寫一些相當......浪漫主義的比喻。雖然放在歷史論文裡實在有濫情的嫌疑，但確實能給人留下印象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他說，“歷史，就是無形的巨人在大地上譜寫的無限多聲部的樂章”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"照他這個比喻，我們這位巨人音樂家，可能寫到新的一小節了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......\n肺裡的空氣被竭盡全力擠壓而出，又被深吸回肺中。\n我絆了一跤，掙扎著爬起來，又向前衝去。\n我能清晰感覺到，有什麼東西正在醞釀。\n就在鐘樓頂層，就在那扇門之後，就在塞茜莉亞所在的地方。\n推開門——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那個瘦弱的女孩在唱歌。\n一首古老的薩卡茲歌謠。\n她唱得如此真摯，嗓音稚嫩，投入了全部的情感。\n我只能呆呆站在原地，竭盡全力屏住呼吸，生怕我雜亂的氣息打擾了歌聲的流動。\n在某個瞬間，我突然發現自己什麼也聽不到了。\n唯有鐘聲，彷彿跨越亙古而來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g4_laterano_cathedralliving"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......鐘聲......從啟示石塔傳來......這怎麼可能......？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那口鐘從來沒有響過啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......只在，只在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"數千年前，初代聖徒還行走於地上的時代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“日間，薩科塔見天上烏黑，不見太陽。夜間，魔鬼的軍兵追來，戕害眾多薩科塔。薩科塔失去許多輝光。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“眾聖徒說：跟隨我。於是石塔矗立。眾聖徒說：聆聽我。於是鐘聲鳴響。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g9_laterano_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“鐘聲回蕩在曠野，薩科塔便結成一心。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔誠的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_365_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“這是啟示，這是箴言。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“日間便有亮光，不再被遮擋。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔誠的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_365_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“眾聖徒說：建築一座城市，乃是薩科塔的樂園。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“眾聖徒說：這城該叫拉特蘭。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎麼會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啟示石塔是拉特蘭最古老的建築之一，不，如果按典籍所載，是先有啟示石塔，再有拉特蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而聖鐘於此刻再度響起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我們的小塞茜莉亞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g4_laterano_cathedralliving"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可，為什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許那位無形的巨人音樂家想要寫幾個強音，看上了拉特蘭的老鐘，在配器時選中它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"樞機薇爾麗芙，此刻在這聖堂中的卻是你我，不知是幸運，還是不幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......教宗閣下，我們必須立刻查清聖鐘鳴響的原因......不，不論是什麼原因，給出這個原因、解釋這個原因的......必須是教廷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正值諸國使節齊聚拉特蘭，出席代表皆為見證者，這未嘗不是個機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，薇爾麗芙，曉諭諸使節，拉特蘭的鐘聲數千年後再度響起，這是變革的預兆，我們必須聯合，為將來做好準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那啟示石塔......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等待已經足夠了，就開始工作吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g9_laterano_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先導，您......難道早就知道了？塞茜莉亞到底是什麼人......她，她雖然是混血，但......難道還有什麼隱藏的秘密？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，怎麼可能。她只是你我所知的塞茜莉亞而已，或許身世有一點特別，但並無玄奧隱秘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許只是，拉特蘭本身都在渴求改變，塞茜莉亞......剛好遭遇了這個時刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又或者，她真是那個能夠彌平薩卡茲和薩科塔千年裂痕的人，以至於啟示為她而降，聖鐘為她而鳴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，也有可能只是個誤會，是個巧合，是個埋藏在歷史中的黑色幽默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們都知道，真相從來不是最重要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......不管怎樣，這給了我們機會。要我說，這未嘗不是我們被眷顧的證明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教廷的精力現在應該都放在了使節區和啟示石塔那邊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們會為您鋪就那條路。您只需向前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......安多恩，鐘聲響了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那鐘聲屬於一個即將啟程的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的語氣很輕鬆，你決定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的決定從未改變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就算會付出一切？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算會付出一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......這有意義嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"意義啊......意義不會憑空存在。我們的一切選擇，不過是構想它，塑造它，給它降臨的機會而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"願你終能平靜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕蒂亞，你剛才的那句話，有違我們的初衷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人人皆為基石，我們所交疊夯築的坦途，留給後來者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g2_laterano_cathedralhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必須立刻覲見教宗閣下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_369_1","isRemote":false,"text":"銃騎泰爾瓦多萊閣下，教宗閣下正在祈禱，暫時不見任何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_369_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請您諒解。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爆炸聲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_369_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概又是市民們的惡作劇吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對！爆炸聲是從使節區傳來的，那裡已經停止所有爆破活動的審批了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戍衛隊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"銃......銃騎泰爾瓦多萊閣下，使節區受到襲擊！城內還有多處發生火災和爆炸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迷途者！聽到聖鐘長鳴，他們終於也坐不住了嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戍衛隊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雖然之前已有銃騎閣下撥駐使節區，但......襲擊和爆炸開始之後，使節們情緒激化，強烈要求增派銃騎保護......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惡，偏偏是這個時候！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"樞機薇爾麗芙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啟示石塔的聖鐘再度鳴響，這是屬於拉特蘭的至聖時刻，首屆“萬國峰會”與各國使節也同蒙恩典，我們都該為此喜悅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而異端殘黨卻趁機作亂，企圖擾亂會議，黯淡拉特蘭的榮光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"銃騎泰爾瓦多萊閣下，奉教宗諭令，請您前往使節區，與諸銃騎一同保護各國使節，確保萬國峰會如期開幕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我將與你同往。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。我說，樞機......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一定也感覺到了，從啟示石塔蔓延出的那股力量......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請慎言，銃騎泰爾瓦多萊閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是榮光。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g7_laterano_ward"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾繆安，這也是他幹的好事嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......或許是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事到如今，你還打算包庇他？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲亞梅塔，過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幹什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"過來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我向你道歉，菲亞梅塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前天，我不該對你說那樣的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你先放開我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除非你原諒我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我確實生你的氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但更讓我生氣的是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也許我是在氣我自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有一點，我希望你相信我，菲亞梅塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他真的想要危害拉特蘭......我絕不會放過他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那他究竟想要做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也許，他是想問一個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"問誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......教宗閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼問題？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個薩科塔不該問的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能說明白點嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......因為我也不太確定。這個問題應該在他心裡埋了很久了......他也沒有說過。只是我的推測。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但八年前的事，確實與這個問題有關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等。所以，莫斯提馬，你也知道？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼可能，我和蕾繆安不一樣，菲亞梅塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾繆安也許是因為理解他，而我嘛......我只是因為，他不值得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要我說，他挺可憐的。而我還有更重要的事要忙。就這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我怎麼覺得你比蕾繆安還讓我生氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不一樣，菲亞梅塔。我做了能做的一切。而你......我猜你寧願是我，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾繆安，你還知道什麼，都告訴我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為你不會想聽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總要聽了才知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g10_laterano_roof"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亞·拉珀爾塔，我奉教宗諭令，前來保護你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是因為鐘響了嗎......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鐘響，和我有關係嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無可奉告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請你即刻動身，隨我前往大教堂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾澤爾哥哥，沒關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_279_excu","aliases":["費德里科"]}]}
